# Cron Jobs

Four scheduled background jobs. All require `Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET`.

## Schedule

| Job | Cron | UTC time | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Expire invites | `0 9 * * *` | Daily 09:00 | Mark stale invites expired |
| Retry invites | `*/30 * * * *` | Every 30 min | Retry pending sends |
| Send reminders | `0 18 * * 2` | Tuesday 18:00 | Session reminder emails |
| Academy rollover | `0 9 1 * *` | 1st of month 09:00 | Season close + rollover |

> Configure in **Cloudflare Pages dashboard** → Settings → Functions → Cron Triggers. Not in `wrangler.toml`.

## Expire invites

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/cron/expire-invites] --> Q[listSentInvitesOlderThan 14 days]
    Q --> Loop{For each invite}
    Loop --> ME[markInviteExpired]
    ME --> EV[appendEnquiryEvent\ninvite_expired]
    EV --> Loop
    Loop -->|Done| R[200 expired: N]
```

**Idempotent** — already-expired invites are not reprocessed.

## Retry invites

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/cron/retry-invites] --> Q[listPendingInvites\nattempts < 3]
    Q --> Loop{For each invite}
    Loop --> Enq[getEnquiryById]
    Enq -->|Not found| Skip[Skip + log]
    Enq -->|Found| Send[sendBookingInvite]
    Send -->|Success| MS[markInviteSent]
    Send -->|Fail| Inc[incrementSendAttempts]
    Inc --> Max{attempts >= 3?}
    Max -->|Yes| Failed[markInviteFailed]
    Max -->|No| Loop
    MS --> Loop
    Loop -->|Done| R[200 retried: N]
```

## Send reminders

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/cron/send-reminders\nTuesday 18:00] --> Q[listUpcomingBookings 7 days]
    Q --> Loop{For each booking}
    Loop --> Check{reminder_sent\nin events log?}
    Check -->|Yes| Skip[Skip — idempotent]
    Check -->|No| Send[sendBookingReminder]
    Send --> EV[appendEnquiryEvent\nreminder_sent + booking_id]
    Skip --> Loop
    EV --> Loop
    Loop -->|Done| R[200 sent: N skipped: M]
```

The `booking_id` in the event ensures idempotency even if an athlete has multiple bookings.

## Academy rollover

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/cron/academy-rollover\n1st of month] --> Open[getOpenAcademySeason]
    Open -->|None| Noop[200 — nothing to do]
    Open -->|Found| Close[updateSeasonStatus closed]
    Close --> List[listWaitlistBySeason\nfilter non-accepted]
    List --> Loop{For each\nunplaced entry}
    Loop --> History[hasAcceptedEntryForEnquiry?]
    History -->|Yes| Returning[is_returning = 1]
    History -->|No| New[is_returning = 0]
    Returning & New --> Reset[Reset: season_id=NULL\nstatus=waiting response=NULL]
    Reset --> Loop
    Loop -->|Done| R[200 rolled_over: N]
```

Returning athletes are flagged so admins can prioritise them in the next season.

